{"meta":{"id":"ops-ex-github-actions","title":"Bài tập: workflow GitHub Actions cho monorepo Angular + Spring Boot — chỉ chạy phần thay đổi, cache, bảo mật token, build image theo SHA, deploy UAT có điều kiện","track":"devops","topic":"cicd","tags":["github-actions","ci","monorepo","docker","security"],"type":"code-challenge","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":35,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-09","private":false,"related":["ops-ci-speed","ops-ci-oidc-secrets","ops-ci-pipeline"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"exercise","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-09","ngVersion":null},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Viết workflow GitHub Actions cho repo có <code>web/</code> (Angular) và <code>api/</code> (Spring Boot): chạy trên mọi pull request vào <code>main</code>, chỉ kiểm tra phần thay đổi; khi merge vào <code>main</code> thì build image <code>api</code> gắn tag commit SHA, đẩy lên registry và deploy UAT. Bảo mật: không khoá cloud dài hạn, token quyền tối thiểu, action ghim SHA.</p>\n"},{"key":"requirements","label":"Yêu cầu","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li>PR: job <code>web</code> (lint, test, build) và <code>api</code> (<code>./mvnw verify</code> có Testcontainers) chỉ chạy khi thư mục tương ứng đổi; cache npm và Maven.</li>\n<li><code>concurrency</code> huỷ lần chạy cũ của cùng PR.</li>\n<li><code>main</code>: build image bằng buildx có cache, tag <code>${{ github.sha }}</code>, đẩy GHCR; cập nhật digest ở repo cấu hình (GitOps) hoặc deploy UAT qua environment.</li>\n<li><code>permissions</code> tối thiểu; OIDC nếu cần cloud; mọi action ghim SHA.</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"key":"hints","label":"Gợi ý","role":"hint","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<ul>\n<li><code>dorny/paths-filter</code> hoặc <code>on.pull_request.paths</code> để lọc.</li>\n<li><code>actions/setup-node</code> có <code>cache: npm</code>; <code>actions/setup-java</code> có <code>cache: maven</code>.</li>\n<li><code>permissions: packages: write</code> chỉ cho job build image.</li>\n<li>Một job &quot;tổng&quot; bắt buộc (required check) phụ thuộc các job con để branch protection hoạt động khi job bị bỏ qua.</li>\n</ul>\n","items":["<code>dorny/paths-filter</code> hoặc <code>on.pull_request.paths</code> để lọc.","<code>actions/setup-node</code> có <code>cache: npm</code>; <code>actions/setup-java</code> có <code>cache: maven</code>.","<code>permissions: packages: write</code> chỉ cho job build image.","Một job &quot;tổng&quot; bắt buộc (required check) phụ thuộc các job con để branch protection hoạt động khi job bị bỏ qua."]},{"key":"quick","label":"Câu trả lời tốt nhất","role":"primary","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Tôi chia workflow thành: job <strong><code>changes</code></strong> phát hiện thư mục nào đổi; job <strong><code>web</code></strong> và <strong><code>api</code></strong> chạy <strong>có điều kiện</strong> theo kết quả đó, mỗi job dùng <strong>cache</strong> sẵn có của <code>setup-node</code>/<code>setup-java</code>; job <strong><code>ci-ok</code></strong> luôn chạy, <strong>tổng hợp kết quả</strong> — đây là check duy nhất được đặt <strong>bắt buộc</strong> trong branch protection (nếu đặt bắt buộc job <code>web</code> mà job bị bỏ qua, PR có thể kẹt hoặc lọt). <strong><code>concurrency</code></strong> theo nhánh huỷ lần chạy cũ khi có commit mới. Ở mức workflow, <code>permissions: contents: read</code>; chỉ job build image xin thêm <strong><code>packages: write</code></strong>; job deploy dùng <strong>environment <code>uat</code></strong> và <strong>OIDC</strong> nếu cần gọi cloud. Image build bằng <strong>buildx</strong> với <strong>cache <code>type=gha</code></strong>, tag bằng <strong>SHA</strong> — bất biến, truy được về commit; sau đó cập nhật <strong>digest</strong> vào repo cấu hình để Argo CD đồng bộ UAT, thay vì pipeline gọi <code>kubectl</code> với quyền cluster. Mọi <code>uses:</code> ghim <strong>commit SHA</strong> đầy đủ (ghi chú phiên bản bên cạnh), có Renovate/Dependabot cập nhật. Kết quả: PR chỉ sửa <code>web</code> chạy ~4 phút thay vì ~15.</p>\n"},{"key":"deep","label":"Trả lời đầy đủ","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Điểm người chấm tìm kiếm: workflow vừa nhanh (chỉ làm phần thay đổi, có cache) vừa an toàn (quyền tối thiểu, không khoá dài hạn, action ghim SHA), và có một cơ chế rõ ràng để branch protection hoạt động đúng khi một số job bị bỏ qua. Phần deploy theo kiểu GitOps — pipeline chỉ cập nhật digest trong repo cấu hình — là chi tiết thể hiện hiểu biết về phân tách quyền.</p>\n<h3>Vì sao job tổng hợp</h3>\n<p>Branch protection yêu cầu check theo tên; job bị <code>if:</code> bỏ qua có trạng thái &quot;skipped&quot; — tuỳ cấu hình có thể chặn merge mãi hoặc cho qua mà không kiểm tra gì. Một job <code>ci-ok</code> với <code>if: always()</code> kiểm tra kết quả các job phụ thuộc cho hành vi rõ ràng.</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú về SHA</h3>\n<p>Trong workflow thật, thay <code>&lt;sha&gt;</code> bằng commit SHA đầy đủ 40 ký tự và để comment phiên bản: <code>uses: actions/checkout@&lt;sha&gt; # v5.0.0</code>.</p>\n"},{"key":"code","label":"Code","role":"detail","answer":true,"empty":false,"html":"<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ci-${{ github.ref }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cancel-in-progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.event_name == 'pull_request' }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  changes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outputs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.filter.outputs.web }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ steps.filter.outputs.api }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@&#x3C;sha></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">filter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dorny/paths-filter@&#x3C;sha></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          filters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            web: ['web/**']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            api: ['api/**']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">needs.changes.outputs.web == 'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    defaults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">working-directory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@&#x3C;sha></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@&#x3C;sha></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cache-dependency-path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">web/package-lock.json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx ng lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx ng test --watch=false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx ng build --configuration production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    needs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">needs.changes.outputs.api == 'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    defaults</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><s